WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.597
(camera shutter clicking)

00:00:01.597 --> 00:00:03.100
(photographers yelling)

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.350
- [Wenxin Fan] Zhao Wei is one of China's

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.750
A-list movie actresses.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.580
At some point, she got
married to a developer,

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.740
a businessman,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.910
and the couple started to make rounds

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.070
in the investment world.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:19.240
That's why the media dubbed her

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.563
as China's female Warren Buffett,

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.960
but recently people found

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.403
that Zhao Wei was being erased
on the Chinese internet.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.810
China's cracking down
on the cultural world

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:36.980
because the party is very much concerned

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:41.053
about some of the influences
over its younger generation.

00:00:43.586 --> 00:00:47.336
(enigmatic percussion music)

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:08.920
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:12.130
She directed a movie
called "So Young" in 2013,

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:15.380
but now the movie's entry
on the Chinese website,

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.480
if we went to Wikipedia,

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:18.620
the name of the director

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:21.350
has been replaced by punctuation marks.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.083
It now reads dash.

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.200
And on the Chinese video streaming sites,

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.370
some of her best movies and TV series

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:33.740
was removed from the sites.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.950
And on Weibo, the microblog site,

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:41.470
her fan page was gone along
with millions of discussions

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:44.393
about her past performance and news.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.540
China has always seen culture

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.540
as part of the force to enforce
the right kind of thinking.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.550
The party sees that the
culture scene recently

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:57.510
has become messy,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.895
especially the so-called fan culture,

00:01:59.895 --> 00:02:02.645
(crowd cheering)

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.933
how celebrities were
worshiped, especially online,

00:02:07.873 --> 00:02:11.190
and the party sees a few
examples of bad characters

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.090
who are sending the wrong message.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:17.420
It is going after these actors
who made a lot of money,

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:20.070
but had tax evasion problems.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.520
One of the celebrities was removed online

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:27.470
because he was found once
visiting a Japanese shrine,

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:31.264
that has always been a
controversial place in China.

00:02:31.264 --> 00:02:35.014
(enigmatic percussion music)

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.300
So at the same time,

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.500
we're seeing the parties cracking down

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:54.130
on the private tutoring industry
because it sees children,

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.650
especially those below K-12

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.880
being influenced too much
outside public schools.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.440
They are also regulating

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:06.913
how the kids are spending time
online playing video games.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:12.330
Zhao Wei's treatment
sent a message to others,

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.320
especially to other celebrities,

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:17.300
because even someone like her,

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.600
someone with her influence

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:23.063
can't avoid being erased online.

00:03:23.998 --> 00:03:27.915
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.680
And maybe even more
scarier is that, you know,

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.433
no reason was given.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:40.680
The government sounds
vague in what they see

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.880
as the correct or the wanted culture.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.870
So whether you have a huge
influence doesn't matter,

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.983
they are at the mercy of
the government's policy.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:56.220
(enigmatic percussion music)

